    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37722" root="لسب" body-key="l">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسَبَهُ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسِبَ</span></b> , (S, K,) and 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسَبَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسْبٌ</span>, (S,) <i>It</i> (a scorpion, S, or a serpent or
other thing, K, as a scorpion, and wasp, but
generally said of a scorpion, TA,) <i>stung him,</i> or
<i>bit him.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسَبَهُ أَسْوَاطًا</span> <i>He flogged him
with whips.</i> (S.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسَبَهُ بِالسَّوْطِ</span> <i>He flogged him
with the whip.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسِبَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسَبَ</span></b> , (S, K,)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسْبٌ</span>, (S,) <i>He licked</i> honey, (S, K,) or
the like, (K,) as clarified butter. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسِبَ بِهِ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَسَبَ</span></b> , <i>It adhered, clave,</i> or <i>stuck, to it,</i>
or <i>in it:</i> (S, K:) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَصِبَ</span>. (S.)

